   "attempts": 2,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "s": 5.949,
   "e": 8.285,
   "text": "And it changes everything.",
   "dur": 2.336,
   "voiced": 99,
   "sim": 0.633,
   "f0": 112.486,
   "st": -1.12,
   "range_st": 4.671,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "s": 9.23,
   "e": 11.75,
   "text": "Go back to the Hebbian memory from chapter four:",
   "dur": 2.52,
   "voiced": 164,
   "sim": 0.731,
   "f0": 120.83,
   "st": 0.119,
   "range_st": 7.342,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 5,
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "s": 11.895,
   "e": 17.486,
   "text": "the matrix that stores associations by adding up outer products, value times key-transpose.",
   "dur": 5.591,
   "voiced": 311,
   "sim": 0.849,
   "f0": 115.744,
   "st": -0.625,
   "range_st": 6.42,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "s": 18.11,
   "e": 20.027,
   "text": "We watched it drown in crosstalk.",
   "dur": 1.917,
   "voiced": 138,
   "sim": 0.649,
   "f0": 118.68,
   "st": -0.191,
   "range_st": 8.628,
   "asr": 0.5,
   "attempts": 6,
   "level": 3,
   "weak": true
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "s": 20.727,
   "e": 22.697,
   "text": "Now look closely at a Transformer.",
   "dur": 1.97,
   "voiced": 134,
   "sim": 0.626,
   "f0": 117.979,
   "st": -0.294,
   "range_st": 9.101,
   "asr": 0.833,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "s": 23.275,
   "e": 25.703,
   "text": "Strip the softmax out of attention,",
   "dur": 2.428,
   "voiced": 123,
   "sim": 0.766,
   "f0": 118.832,
   "st": -0.169,
   "range_st": 5.264,
   "asr": 0.833,
   "attempts": 2,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "s": 26.237,
   "e": 29.331,
   "text": "and something extraordinary is left behind.",
   "dur": 3.095,
   "voiced": 171,
   "sim": 0.669,
   "f0": 117.965,
   "st": -0.296,
   "range_st": 6.908,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "s": 29.551,
   "e": 34.877,
   "text": "Every new token writes its value, times its key-transpose, into a running matrix.",
   "dur": 5.326,
   "voiced": 329,
   "sim": 0.805,
   "f0": 120.587,
   "st": 0.084,
   "range_st": 8.615,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "s": 35.366,
   "e": 38.613,
   "text": "Every query reads from that matrix, by multiplication.",
   "dur": 3.248,
   "voiced": 197,
   "sim": 0.734,
   "f0": 114.409,
   "st": -0.826,
   "range_st": 7.715,
   "asr": 0.875,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "s": 39.552,
   "e": 41.032,
   "text": "That is Hebb's rule.",
   "dur": 1.48,
   "voiced": 81,
   "sim": 0.526,
   "f0": 112.86,
   "st": -1.062,
   "range_st": 4.659,
   "asr": 0.75,
   "attempts": 5,
   "level": 2,
   "weak": true
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "s": 41.252,
   "e": 41.786,
   "text": "Exactly.",
   "dur": 0.534,
   "voiced": 39,
   "sim": 0.392,
   "f0": 128.426,
   "st": 1.175,
   "range_st": 3.389,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "s": 42.834,
   "e": 48.465,
   "text": "In 2021, Imanol Schlag, Kazuki Irie and J\u00fcrgen Schmidhuber proved it formally.",
   "dur": 5.631,
   "voiced": 385,
   "sim": 0.802,
   "f0": 116.199,
   "st": -0.557,
   "range_st": 4.229,
   "asr": 0.867,
   "attempts": 6,
   "level": 3
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "s": 48.685,
   "e": 51.177,
   "text": "Linear attention is a fast weight programmer:",
   "dur": 2.492,
   "voiced": 194,
   "sim": 0.768,
   "f0": 117.993,
   "st": -0.292,
   "range_st": 7.431,
   "asr": 0.857,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "s": 51.467,
   "e": 58.987,
   "text": "a slow network that learns, by gradient descent, to write fast synaptic weights while it is thinking.",
   "dur": 7.52,
   "voiced": 368,
   "sim": 0.806,
   "f0": 116.059,
   "st": -0.578,
   "range_st": 3.82,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "s": 60.506,
   "e": 64.021,
   "text": "The idea is older than the Transformer itself.",
   "dur": 3.516,
   "voiced": 196,
   "sim": 0.631,
   "f0": 109.832,
   "st": -1.533,
   "range_st": 2.885,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "s": 64.749,
   "e": 71.269,
   "text": "In 2016, Jimmy Ba and Geoffrey Hinton argued that brains have synapses that change faster than learning,",
   "dur": 6.52,
   "voiced": 504,
   "sim": 0.824,
   "f0": 117.921,
   "st": -0.302,
   "range_st": 7.356,
   "asr": 0.842,
   "attempts": 2,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "s": 71.693,
   "e": 73.568,
   "text": "but slower than thought,",
   "dur": 1.875,
   "voiced": 93,
   "sim": 0.618,
   "f0": 125.914,
   "st": 0.833,
   "range_st": 4.192,
   "asr": 0.75,
   "attempts": 2,
   "level": 0,
   "weak": true
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "s": 74.188,
   "e": 78.366,
   "text": "and that these fast weights are a neurally plausible way to attend to the recent past.",
   "dur": 4.178,
   "voiced": 327,
   "sim": 0.865,
   "f0": 116.009,
   "st": -0.586,
   "range_st": 2.626,
   "asr": 0.875,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "s": 79.277,
   "e": 82.544,
   "text": "So the Transformer never rejected Hebb.",
